= Ángel Galarza

Galarza is a <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> deputy and the party's authority on public order and internal security. His priority is turning the Republic's police against the enemies plotting its overthrow.

- @regional_affairs
- @police_affairs
- @root: Return to main

@regional_affairs
title: Public Order in Catalonia
subtitle: Galarza can coordinate with the Generalitat over public order in Catalonia.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psoe_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; catalan_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: catalan_affairs


@police_affairs
title: Police affairs
subtitle: We can press the government on internal-security policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; police_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: police
